   7:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** /*
   8:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** ExpressionHandler class 
   9:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** author: Keith Bloemer
  10:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** date  : 5/23/2024
  11:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  12:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** This class was written to handle an expression pedal on the Funbox v3 guitar pedal hardware.
  13:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** It was written with a specific expression operation in mind, but is independant of a specific 
  14:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** control scheme. It requires a way to engage a "Expression Set Mode", and a "Clear Expression" actio
  15:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** as well as an arbitrary number of knobs able to be controlled by the expression pedal.
  16:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  17:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** Intended operating sequence:
  18:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  19:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 1. Hold both footswitches (more than .5 seconds) to engage Expression Set Mode. Both LEDs dim to in
  20:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  21:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 2. Move the expression pedal into the fully up position, and set one boundary of any knobs to apply
  22:../../include/expressionHandler.h ****    Right LED brightens to indicate it's ready to set the UP position.
  23:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  24:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 3. Move the expression pedal into the fully down position, and set the other boundary of any knobs 
  25:../../include/expressionHandler.h ****    Left LED brightens to indicate it's ready to set the DOWN position.
  26:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  27:../../include/expressionHandler.h ****    Note: The Up/Down knob settings must be different to be set as active for Expression. If they ar
  28:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  29:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 4. Redo step 2 or 3 as desired, in either order.
  30:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  31:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 5. Hold both footswitches (more than .5 seconds) to exit Expression Set Mode and Engage Expression.
  32:../../include/expressionHandler.h ****    are now controlled by the Expression pedal within the chosen ranges. LEDs return to normal opera
  33:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  34:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 6. Re-Enter Expression Set mode to end the current expression settings and choose new ones.
  35:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  36:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 7. Hold both footswitches longer than 2 seconds to clear all expression settings and exit any expre
  37:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  38:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** */
  39:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** 
  40:../../include/expressionHandler.h **** class ExpressionHandler
